{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aBook Shooter\u300bis a magic shooting game similar to rogue, tower defense, and vampire survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the mysterious forbidden area, you are awakened as a book, with a Bible that can do magic, advanced mathematics that can fight, and a The Emperor's New \uff08Clothes\u00d7\uff09Book\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods in the forbidden area want to devour you all the time. Open the magic book to learn magic, defeat the gods, and get the forbidden power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/\u4e66\u672c\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1753297301\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/\u5f00\u5c40\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1753297301\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can freely match books, title pages, colleges, and concentration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/\u5f00\u5c40\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1753297301\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/\u722c\u5854\u73a9\u6cd5-\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1753297301\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progressive challenges, diverse enemies and rewards, powerful enemies are waiting for you to challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/\u722c\u5854\u82f1\u6587.gif?t=1753297301\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/